target
prisma-cli/prisma/migrations
/.idea
**/.DS_Store
.env.*
# SQLx offline query cache. Generated by `cargo sqlx prepare` in CI
# (.github/workflows/docker.yml) before the image build, because
# backend/Dockerfile compiles with SQLX_OFFLINE=true and a live database is not
# available there. Do not commit it: it is a build artifact that has to be
# regenerated whenever a query changes. Locally the query! macros resolve against
# DATABASE_URL in backend/.env instead.
**/.sqlx
# SpiceDB gRPC bindings, generated by `buf generate` (see buf.gen.yaml). Do not
# commit them: they are a build artifact produced before every `cargo build` in
# CI (.github/workflows/rust.yml, .github/workflows/docker.yml) and the Docker
# image (backend/Dockerfile). Run the same command in backend/ locally before
# building on a fresh checkout.
server/src/spicedb/generated